#. * users can't express their opinions here. In some languages
#. * "Review (evaluate) something" is a different translation than
#. * "Review (browse) something."
#: src/gs-update-monitor.c:1447
msgctxt "updates"
msgid "Review"
msgstr "ᱧᱮᱞᱟᱹᱨᱩ"

